WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.244
It was time for school.

2
00:00:06.245 --> 00:00:10.569
But Harry didn't feel well.

3
00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:16.818
"Today is a sick day," Mom said.

4
00:00:16.819 --> 00:00:22.295
Harry moaned. "I hate sick days.

5
00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:25.905
And today is the class party."

6
00:00:25.906 --> 00:00:30.921
"Sorry, Harry," Mom said.

7
00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:35.859
"You're staying home."

8
00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:39.993
Aunt Judy stayed home with Harry.

9
00:00:39.994 --> 00:00:45.261
"I hate sick days," Harry said.

10
00:00:45.262 --> 00:00:49.834
"Tell me about the class party," Aunt Judy said.

11
00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:53.434
"There will be games," Harry said.

12
00:00:53.435 --> 00:00:59.345
His head hurt too much to play games.

13
00:00:59.346 --> 00:01:07.718
"There will be juice," he said.

14
00:01:07.719 --> 00:01:13.278
His throat hurt when he drank juice.

15
00:01:13.279 --> 00:01:19.604
"The class will eat cupcakes," he said.

16
00:01:19.605 --> 00:01:25.080
Harry did not want to eat anything.

17
00:01:25.081 --> 00:01:28.878
"The class will watch a movie," he said.

18
00:01:28.879 --> 00:01:34.813
Harry was too tired to watch a movie.

19
00:01:34.814 --> 00:01:37.389
Soon Harry fell asleep.

20
00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:43.974
Aunt Judy went downstairs.

21
00:01:43.975 --> 00:01:51.664
When Harry woke up, he felt better.

22
00:01:51.665 --> 00:02:00.372
But school was over now.

23
00:02:00.373 --> 00:02:05.389
"I missed everything," thought Harry.

24
00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:10.768
Emmy and Oliver came home.

25
00:02:10.769 --> 00:02:15.774
Then Mom and Dad came home.

26
00:02:15.775 --> 00:02:20.470
Aunt Judy said, "It's time for our party!"

27
00:02:20.471 --> 00:02:24.039
"What?" Harry said.

28
00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:27.976
Aunt Judy brought out juice and cupcakes.

29
00:02:27.977 --> 00:02:32.150
She brought out games and a movie.

30
00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:36.484
"This party is for Harry," Aunt Judy said.

31
00:02:36.485 --> 00:02:48.666
"Because he feels well again."

32
00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:52.380
"I love sick days," Harry said.

33
00:02:52.381 --> 00:03:00.730
"Maybe I'll stay home again tomorrow!"

